      "signature": "private.dic_canonical_roaster_key(value text)",
      "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION private.dic_canonical_roaster_key(value text)\n RETURNS text\n LANGUAGE sql\n STABLE SECURITY DEFINER\n SET search_path TO ''\nAS $function$\n with input as (select private.dic_roaster_key(value) as key)\n select coalesce(\n   (select a.canonical_key from private.dic_roaster_name_aliases a\n      join input i on i.key=a.alias_key limit 1),\n   (select key from input)\n );\n$function$\n",
